{'symbol': 'BDX', 'date': '2019-11-24 22:30:00', 'title': 'BECTON, DICKINSON AND COMPANY DECLARES QUARTERLY COMMON SHARE DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 31, 2019; DECLARES 6.125% MANDATORY CONVERTIBLE PREFERRED STOCK DIVIDEND, SERIES A, PAYABLE ON FEBRUARY 1, 2020', 'text': 'THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF BECTON, DICKINSON AND COMPANY HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.79 CENTS PER COMMON SHARE, AN INCREASE OF 2.6% FROM THE PREVIOUS QUARTER. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 31, 2019 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD ON DECEMBER 10, 2019. IN ADDITION, THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $15.3125 PER SHARE ON THE 6.125% MANDATORY CONVERTIBLE PREFERRED STOCK, SERIES A, PAYABLE ON FEBRUARY 1, 2020 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD ON JANUARY 15, 2020.'}